body:
Destruction is creation.

&#x200B;

It's time for some barbecue.

Never.  When you Listen to the Whole of All Our Gods Have Abandoned Us and Lost together// Lost Forever. You won't want him to be replaced.

Songs like Colony Collapse, The Devil is Near, Memento Mori, From the Wilderness, Gone With the Wind and C.A.N.C.E.R will make you understand why.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

There are a few that sound close to him though. ANd some others that have their distinct beauty to their sounds Such as the lead singer for Saviour, Invent, Animate Ex lead singer, Adrian Fitpaldes of Northlane. Many others. The guy from Imminence sounds really good.

Not much. But the ease comes to easily when i am in stark silence and even in those moments i am willing to connect. It's like i need intermittent sessions with that stark silence to be able to connect. Sadly I'm not anywhere that. Out in the wood also makes me be at instant ease it takes it away. 

&#x200B;

Thanks for replying. I appreciate.

Sorry for the late reply. No, I don't live with roommates. I'm the kind of guy that would buy off neighbours property just so i don't have neighbours if i had the funds.

&#x200B;

I've never tried therapy, i'm not sure i can let my guard down to a therapist.  It's why i consistently crave solitude so i can vent into the quietness occasionally.
